Now CSS. Let me adjust the `.auction-podium`, `#auctionImg`, add `.podium-column`, and update `.podium-base` sizing/margins. Current CSS:

```
.auction-podium {
  position: absolute;
  left: 50%;
  bottom: 11%;
  z-index: 6;
  width: 184px;
  transform: translateX(-50%);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
}
.podium-halo {... bottom:24px ...}
#auctionImg { ... width:172; height:172; ... }
.podium-base {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 3;
  width: 154px;
  margin-top: -9px;
  padding: 8px 8px 10px;
  ...
}
```

New:
```
.auction-podium { width: 196px; bottom: 9%; }
.podium-halo { bottom: 60px; width: 200px; height: 200px; }
#auctionImg { width: 172px; height: 172px; margin-bottom: -2px; }
.podium-column {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 2;
  width: 84px;
  height: 48px;
  margin-top: -8px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(231,202,146,.16);
  border-radius: 4px 4px 2px 2px;
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, #503a26 0%, #2d1f13 48%, #150e08 100%);
  box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.5), inset 0 1px rgba(255,238,195,.16), inset 0 -8px 16px rgba(0,0,0,.3);
}
.podium-column::before { /* top cap */ content:''; position:absolute; left:-12px; right:-12px; top:-6px; height:13px; border-radius:50%; background: linear-gradient(180deg,#5b422b,#24170d); border:1px solid rgba(231,202,146,.2); box-shadow: inset 0 1px rgba(255,240,200,.22), 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.4); }
.podium-column::after { /* front bevel / gold line */ content:''; position:absolute; left:10px; right:10px; bottom:9px; height:1px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(226,190,119,.35), transparent); }
.podium-base { width: 170px; margin-top: -2px; padding: 7px 8px 9px; border-radius: 3px 3px 5px 5px; ... }
```

But careful: the column at width 84 will visually connect artifact bottom center to the base. Artifact image 172 with transparent margins; actual artifact occupies ~80% of image; bottom of art likely around y=160. Column top at image bottom minus 8. Fine.

Also the `.podium-halo` should center around artifact, bottom 60.

At max-height 720 media query, adjust column too:
```
.podium-column { height: 38px; width: 72px; }
.podium-base { width: 150px; }
#auctionImg { width: 140; height: 140; }
.auction-podium { bottom: 7%; width: 170px; }
```

